# DataForSEO pipeline output
# raw/ and manifests/ are bulky, transient dumps of paid API calls — keep the
# folders in git, ignore their contents. compiled/ rollups stay tracked because
# they are the artifacts the agent actually reads.
dataforseo/raw/*
!dataforseo/raw/.gitkeep
dataforseo/manifests/*
!dataforseo/manifests/.gitkeep
